  "result": "Perfect! All 348 tests pass. The renderInvoiceText function has been successfully enhanced with all the requested features.\n\n## renderInvoiceText Polish Complete \u2713\n\n**Enhanced Features:**\n\n1. **Line Discounts** - Each line shows its discount (regular + bulk combined) when applicable\n   - Displayed indented under the line item\n   - Format: `  Discount: \u20acXX.XX`\n   - Only shown if discount > 0\n\n2. **Voucher** - Displayed before VAT and Total\n   - Format: `Voucher: \u20acXX.XX`\n   - Only shown if voucher amount > 0\n\n3. **Due Date** - Shows invoice due date when present\n   - Format: `Due: YYYY-MM-DD`\n   - Placed near the end of invoice\n   - Only shown if invoice has a due date\n\n4. **Paid Amount** - Shows total amount paid when payments exist\n   - Format: `Paid: \u20acXX.XX`\n   - Sums all payments\n   - Last line of invoice\n   - Only shown if invoice has payments\n\n**Example Output:**\n```\nINV-2026-0042\nNorthwind Studio\n10 Development (hour) \u20ac95.00 \u20ac950.00\n  Discount: \u20ac116.38\n3 Design work (hour) \u20ac85.00 \u20ac255.00\nVoucher: \u20ac50.00\nVAT: \u20ac228.61\nTotal: \u20ac1,267.23\nDue: 2026-11-06\nPaid: \u20ac600.00\n```\n\n**Test Coverage (18 comprehensive tests):**\n\n\u2714 Line discount display (regular + bulk)  \n\u2714 Omits discount line when no discount  \n\u2714 Bulk discount only (no regular discount)  \n\u2714 Multiple lines with varied discounts  \n\u2714 Voucher display with positioning  \n\u2714 Omits voucher when not present  \n\u2714 Due date display  \n\u2714 Omits due date when not present  \n\u2714 Paid amount with single payment  \n\u2714 Paid amount sums multiple payments  \n\u2714 Omits paid line when no payments  \n\u2714 Complete invoice with all features  \n\nAll features work together seamlessly while maintaining clean, readable output suitable for printing or display.",
